Metal-center effect induced efficient charge transfer of metal-organic framework for strengthening Sb(V) capture performance
Deng You\(^{1,2,3}\), Hui Shi\(^{2,3}\), Mingming Peng\(^{2,3}\), Liming Yang\(^{2,3}\), Penghui Shao\(^{2,3}\), Kai Yin\(^{1}\), Haozhi Wang\(^{4}\), Shenglian Luo\(^{1}\) (✉), and Xubiao Luo\(^{2,3}\) (✉)
